member.summary:
Example Usage:

 static void Test()
 {
   using (AutoReleaseMutex arm = new AutoReleaseMutex(_mux)) // Where _mux is your own Mutex data member.
   {
     // Call WaitOne on the mutex.
     arm.WaitOne();

     // Do work

     // ReleaseMutex will be automatically be called (even if there is an exception thrown from within the using.
   }

 }
